          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The mean of a set of 10 numbers is 5. A new number is added and the mean stays the same.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p28-q17-bank-p28-q17-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "What was the number?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5$; the added number must equal the existing mean.",
          "worked": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p28-q17-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "right",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "For the mean to stay the same, the new number must be the current mean.",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "break"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "So, 5.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p28-q17-total-working",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{align*}\\text{Original total}&=10\\times5=50\\\\\\text{New total}&=11\\times5=55\\\\\\text{Added number}&=55-50=5\\end{align*}",
                    "display": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q17-bank-p28-q17-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Optional: Instead of adding one number, add 2 and 8 to the original dataset. Confirm that the mean stays the same.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{50+2+8}{12}=5$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Original total}&=10\\times5=50\\\\\\text{New mean}&=\\frac{50+2+8}{12}=5\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q17-bank-p28-q17-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Optional: What is special about the numbers 2 and 8 in relation to the original mean?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Both are $3$ from the mean, on opposite sides.",
          "worked": "$5-2=3$ and $8-5=3$. They are equally far below and above the mean, so their mean is also $5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q17-bank-p28-q17-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "Optional: If you add 3 to the original dataset, what other number do you need to add to keep the mean the same?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Required total}&=12\\times5=60\\\\\\text{Other number}&=60-50-3=7\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      }
    ]
  },
